@startuml
title RAMT - Translation Request Sequence
autonumber

actor User
participant "Streamlit UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI RAMT API" as API
participant "Text Normalizer" as Norm
participant "LaBSE Encoder" as LaBSE
database "FAISS Index" as FAISS
database "Translation Memory DB" as TMDB
participant "Context Builder" as Context
participant "IndicNLP + SentencePiece" as Prep
participant "IndicTrans2" as MT
participant "Output Postprocessor" as Post

User -> UI : Enter English sentence
UI -> API : Submit translation request
API -> Norm : Clean and normalize text
Norm --> API : Normalized sentence

API -> LaBSE : Encode normalized sentence
LaBSE --> API : Query vector

API -> FAISS : Search nearest vectors
FAISS --> API : Candidate IDs + similarity scores

API -> TMDB : Fetch candidate bilingual pairs
TMDB --> API : Candidate pairs + metadata

alt At least one candidate passes threshold
  API -> Context : Supply accepted top-k examples
  Context --> API : Prepared retrieval context
else No candidate passes threshold
  API -> Context : Supply empty context
  Context --> API : Baseline fallback context
end

API -> Context : Compose input and protect entities
Context --> API : Prepared source + context

API -> Prep : Normalize, map scripts and tokenize
Prep --> API : Model-ready input

API -> MT : Generate target-language sequence
MT --> API : Generated target tokens

API -> Post : Restore script and entities
Post --> API : Final translation

API --> UI : Translation + retrieval information
UI --> User : Display result

@enduml